{"id":"o-topspinfishing-com","claimKey":"c293e6769aec56d2fde18fda13a4a0e5635d4cd7a6dca08063d58ab2bfd7a8ed","title":"Topspin Fishing Charters","cat":"water","art":"fishing","area":"Nantucket, MA","metroId":"cape-cod","src":"topspinfishing.com","rating":5,"reviews":62,"specs":["Fish species include striped bass, bluefish, fluke, black seabass, bonito, false albacore, bluefin tuna","35-foot Terry Jason vessel","Boat accommodates up to six anglers"],"options":[{"name":"5 Hour fishing Trip","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Boat tour","detail":"","price":null},{"name":"Full Day Offshore Fishing Charter","detail":"full day","price":null},{"name":"Half Day Inshore Fishing Charter","detail":"half day","price":null},{"name":"7.5 Hour Inshore Fishing Trip","detail":"7.5 hours","price":null}],"services":[{"name":"5 Hour fishing Trip","desc":"Do you feel that little bit of crisp in the air? I love this time of year. I have always loved the cool mornings and a warm sunny afternoon. We can appreciate the nice days and sleep well in the cooler nights. And yet, the shorter days remind us that the winter blanket is coming…eventually. In the meantime, there is still plenty of fishing. The striped bass fishing isn’t the “easy” button it has been but it’s still pretty good. It requires a little finesse and smaller presentation, and you might want to think about your leader size. And whenever we have a run of bigger tides, you’ll see it get a little easier. Just keep at it. It’s the last month of fluke which closes September 23rd. Pick","photo":"https://irp.cdn-website.com/726d5aba/dms3rep/multi/opt/IMG_1595_e3a40f7172c3e2402cbe8afa5c931de5-1920w.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":0}]},{"name":"Boat tour","desc":"This trip is our \"go-to\" most popular trip. Our 5-hour trips are a great way to spend some quality time on the water, and give us the opportunity to target striped bass, black seabass, fluke, and of course giant bluefish. We adapt to the best options of the day for the weather, the season, and interests. Our full day offshore trip is for those who want to test their endurance on the heavy weight of the northeast - the bluefin tuna - or maybe one of the many tooth creatures in our Atlantic waters. We are fortunate to be part of the world class fishery for recreational and commercial bluefin tuna. Offshore trips also provide a great opportunity to see whales, pelagic bird species, and other","photo":"https://irp.cdn-website.com/726d5aba/dms3rep/multi/opt/IMG_4158-1920w.jpg","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":null,"optionIdx":1}]},{"name":"Full Day Offshore Fishing Charter","desc":null,"variants":[{"label":"full day","price":null,"optionIdx":2}]},{"name":"Half Day Inshore Fishing Charter","desc":null,"variants":[{"label":"half day","price":null,"optionIdx":3}]},{"name":"7.5 Hour Inshore Fishing Trip","desc":null,"variants":[{"label":"7.5 hours","price":null,"optionIdx":4}]}],"includes":["All gear provided"],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices not stated","blurb":"Guests fish for species including striped bass, bluefish, fluke, black seabass, bonito, false albacore, and bluefin tuna. Trips range from half-day inshore to full-day offshore charters targeting bluefin tuna and other species. The 35-foot Terry Jason vessel accommodates up to six anglers for family or friend groups.","cover":"https://scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/772973234_18386586394161740_2117801509143929046_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_tt6&_nc_cat=109&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=18de74&efg=eyJlZmdfdGFnIjoiQ0xJUFMuYmVzdF9pbWFnZV91cmxnZW4uQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=PcWbYbLXCtkQ7kNvwFHYcdz&_nc_oc=AdpX7I-53876SV3bcinXdAtAa1FUmdunAWna7PCtfvvyQZeEsW03zXVp5V0cj_fZqzo&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com&edm=ANo9K5cEAAAA&_nc_gid=DVCaVwizjr6wPqIEzrfSlA&_nc_tpa=Q5bMBQLGi995l8rqVjQ5EtdQ94NSSmvEoIJ8E4lDwuzUnRCeGJQkqWKrB12EqIz9f123tFLqVJDw1gFKvA&oh=00_AQJG8HD0Co9GE5aoJZ-23hiduQ2H9qJsbWEag9dit_TeIg&oe=6AA58F61","photos":["https://scontent-iad6-1.cdninstagram.com